OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has announced new tariffs on
OL,7,Fsome of its biggest trade partners,
OL,8,Fincluding China and the European Union
OL,10,FDifferent tariffs will apply to
OL,11,Fdifferent countries and products -
OL,12,FChina is facing the highest rate of "up
OL,13,Fto 40%", although the effective rate
OL,14,Fcould be lower
OL,16,FThe new tariffs are a response to what
OL,17,Fthe US calls "structural excess
OL,18,Findustrial capacity"
